All that certain tract or parcel of land, situated, lying and being in Haddonfield Borough, County of Camden, and State of New Jersey, more particularly described as follows:

AMENDED

BEGINNING AT A POINT IN THE NORTHEASTERLY LINE OF PENNBROOK DRIVE, 50' WIDE, A DISTANCE OF 310.00 FEET SOUTHEASTWARDLY FROM A POINT IN THE SOUTHEASTERLY LINE OF GREENMOUNT ROAD, 50' WIDE, BOUNDED AND DESCRIBED AS FOLLOWS:

THENCE (1) SOUTH 71 DEGREES 53 MINUTES 10 SECONDS EAST ALONG THE NORTHEASTERLY LINE OF PENNBROOK DRIVE, A DISTANCE OF 23.67 FEET TO AN ANGLE POINT;

THENCE (2) NORTH 87 DEGREES 07 MINUTES 30 SECONDS EAST ALONG THE NORTHERLY LINE OF PENNBROOK DRIVE, A DISTANCE OF 125.26 FEET TO AN ANGLE POINT;

THENCE (3) NORTH 56 DEGREES 40 MINUTES 00 SECONDS EAST ALONG THE NORTHERLY LINE OF PENNBROOK DRIVE, A DISTANCE OF 36.39 FEET TO A POINT AND CORNER/IRON PIPE;

THENCE (4) NORTH 33 DEGREES 20 MINUTES 00 SECONDS WEST ALONG THE DIVISION LINE BETWEEN LOT 11 AND LOT NOS. 10, 8 AND 7, BLOCK 64.21 ON THE OFFICIAL TAX MAP, A DISTANCE OF 208.80 FEET TO A POINT AND CORNER/CONCRETE MARKER;

THENCE (5) SOUTH 18 DEGREES 06 MINUTES 50 SECONDS WEST ALONG THE DIVISION LINE BETWEEN LOT 11 AND LOT 12, SAID BLOCK, A DISTANCE OF 203.45 FEET TO THE POINT AND PLACE OF BEGINNING.

